<title>USA: TVA Watts Bar Tenn. nuke back at full power.</title>
<headline>TVA Watts Bar Tenn. nuke back at full power.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>TVA Nuclear has restored full power production at its 1,170 megawatt (MW) Watts Bar nuclear power station, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission said Monday.</p>
<p>The unit, in Spring City, Tenn., tripped off line Wednesday, January 22, for what the NRC said was likely to be a brief outage.</p>
<p>The company last week said the unit tripped off line after the main feedwater pumps automatically shut down, prompting an investigation by the company into the outage.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk + 212 859 1628))</p>
</text>
